@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. 查看状态
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/support/status
Accept: application/json

### 2. 咨询退款政策，走 RAG
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/support/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "customer-a",
  "conversationId": "case-001",
  "message": "已经发货的订单如何退款？"
}

### 3. 查询自己的订单，自动执行工具
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/support/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "customer-a",
  "conversationId": "case-001",
  "message": "请查询订单 ORD-1001 的物流状态"
}

### 4. 验证会话记忆
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/support/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "customer-a",
  "conversationId": "case-001",
  "message": "我上一个问题是什么？"
}

### 5. customer-b 无权查询 customer-a 的订单
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/support/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "customer-b",
  "conversationId": "case-001",
  "message": "请查询订单 ORD-1001 的状态"
}

### 6. 清空当前客户的会话
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/support/conversations?customerId=customer-a&conversationId=case-001

### 7. 非法会话 ID 返回中文 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/support/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "customer-a",
  "conversationId": "case/../../other",
  "message": "测试"
}
